# 📘 TOEFL Academic Words - Day 12

| Word | Meaning |
|---|---|
| consequently | 결과적으로 |
| decline | 감소하다 |
| maintain | 유지하다 |

---

## Examples

The population declined significantly.

The company maintained a stable level of production.

The temperature increased; consequently, the ice melted faster.

---

## Synonyms

decline
→ decrease / reduce

maintain
→ preserve / keep

consequently
→ therefore / as a result
